flowchart TD
  Start[Verified author submits post] --> Validate[Validate title, content, image and visibility]
  Validate --> Valid{Valid?}
  Valid -->|No| Reject[Return validation errors]
  Valid -->|Yes| Draft{Visibility = draft?}
  Draft -->|Yes| Persist[Create post with draft visibility]
  Draft -->|No| Empty{Published content empty?}
  Empty -->|Yes| Reject
  Empty -->|No| Persist
  Persist --> Slug[Generate unique slug from title]
  Slug --> Record[(Persist Post)]
  Record --> Done[Redirect to dashboard]
  Done -.-> Missing[Future: owner policy, HTML sanitizer, media cleanup and lifecycle timestamps]
